"Fleet and incident vulnerabilities: queries NVD, CISA KEV and FIRST EPSS"
msgstr ""
"Vulnerabilidades do parque e de incidentes: consulta NVD, CISA KEV e FIRST "
"EPSS"

msgid "Actively exploited (CISA KEV catalog)"
msgstr "Explorada ativamente (catálogo CISA KEV)"

